---
const requestSnippet = `curl -X POST https://your.trace/api/executions/ingest \\
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer $TRACE_KEY' \\
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\
  -H 'X-Environment: staging' \\
  --data-binary @cucumber.json`;

const responseSnippet = `207 Multi-Status
{
  "status":           "FAILED",
  "executions": [
    { "feature_code": "auth-3", "execution_id": "exec_01HQK8T9X3",
      "status": "PASSED", "scenarios_matched": 4, "matched_via": "code" },
    { "feature_code": "auth-4", "execution_id": "exec_01HQK8T9X4",
      "status": "FAILED", "scenarios_matched": 2, "matched_via": "name" }
  ],
  "unknown_features": ["Forgot password flow"],
  "warnings":         [
    "Feature 'User login' matched by name; add '@trace=auth-3' to the Gherkin for stable matching."
  ]
}`;
---

<section id="api" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 border-t border-border">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-3">
        <span class="inline-block size-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        HTTP API
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
        One endpoint. cucumber.json in, execution out.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-ink-2 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Bearer auth, scoped to a project. One header for the environment. The body is the cucumber.json your runner already emits. That's it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden shadow-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-border px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-3">
        <span class="text-accent-soft-ink uppercase tracking-wider">POST</span>
        <span class="text-ink-2">/api/executions/ingest</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="px-4 py-4 font-mono text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre">{requestSnippet}</pre>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface-2/40 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-border px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-3">
        <span class="text-pass-ink uppercase tracking-wider">Response</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="px-4 py-4 font-mono text-[12.5px] text-ink-2 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre">{responseSnippet}</pre>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink-3 leading-relaxed">
      Unknown features in the payload come back in <span class="font-mono text-ink-2">unknown_features</span> so your CI can warn instead of silently dropping them. Warnings nudge you toward <span class="font-mono text-ink-2">@trace=&lt;code&gt;</span> tags for stable matching across renames.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
